      "en": "There were six steps to the throne, and the top of the throne was round behind; and there were armrests on either side by the place of the seat, and two lions standing beside the armrests.",
      "ko": "그 보좌에는 여섯 층계가 있고 보좌 뒤에 둥근 머리가 있고 앉는 자리 양편에는 팔걸이가 있고 팔걸이 곁에는 사자가 하나씩 섰으며",
      "source_text_hash": "f08f46d7667c27ace25bdca2bfecd390032d518b9135668c452a0fe326765714",
      "translation_text_hash": "97e9020c3d16bf2e30d3db3d5453e29d4d55e6e6ea6f398cc29abe427f2bbba0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
