      "en": "Twelve lions stood there on the one side and on the other on the six steps. Nothing like it was made in any kingdom.",
      "ko": "또 열 두 사자가 있어 그 여섯 층계 좌우편에 섰으니 아무 나라에도 이같이 만든 것이 없었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e51e591a68acaef11fc3dc48b91c253c6ab0210dce1e903e120d8ca43a847ddf",
      "translation_text_hash": "0f518275a77380f277234c8da596c6f6c0fafb798cd2db642dd02d33b1aecd5e",
