      "en": "So King Solomon exceeded all the kings of the earth in riches and in wisdom.",
      "ko": "솔로몬왕의 재산과 지혜가 천하 열왕보다 큰지라",
      "source_text_hash": "9929482a1aa6e0a6bc068abaf580e4c30e7faf25969d4141546f09fe1ed89875",
      "translation_text_hash": "004e9034eb53596cdfba96ecb3a5fc22867bd9137b7434dcaf727a8da82c2a56",
